<report>
<title>Proportion meta-analysis</title>

<p>Method: @methodLabel</p>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Responding</th><th>Total</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="inputs"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@r</td><td>@n</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Proportion</th><th colspan="2"><ci>@pc% CI (exact)</ci></th><th></th></tr>
<block name="proportions"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{p:roundu}</td><td><ci>@{from_y:roundu}</ci></td><td><ci>@{to_y:roundu}</ci></td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><th colspan="2">% Weights (fixed, random)</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="proportions"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{yi:roundu}</td><td>@{vi:roundu}</td><td>@{wt:roundu}</td><td>@{dwt:roundu}</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<p><u>Fixed effects (inverse variance)</u><br />
Pooled proportion = @{rmh:roundu} (<ci>@pc% CI = @{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu}</ci>)</p>

<p><u>Non-combinability of studies</u><br />
Cochran Q = @{qc:roundu}  (df = @df)  <pval>@{xp:pval}</pval><br />
Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = @{tausq:roundu}<br />
I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = @isq% (<ci>@pc1% CI = @llisq% to @ulisq%</ci>) </p>

<p><u>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</u><br />
Pooled proportion = @{dspr:roundu} (<ci>@pc% CI = @{from_ds:roundu} to @{to_ds:roundu}</ci>)</p>

<p><u>Bias indicators</u></p>
<block name="egger">
<p>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's @tau  <pval>@{p2:pval}</pval><br />
Egger: bias = @a (<ci>@pc_egger% CI = @cl to @cu</ci>)  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
<block name="harbord">
<p>Harbord: bias = @a (<ci>@pc_harbord% CI = @cl to @cu</ci>)  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
</report>
